  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Bug-fix release:\n\t\t\t- Async test methods fully supported (the specification context now follows the test's async flow)\n\t\t\t- TSpec.Assert works standalone, without a Spec base class\n\t\t\t- Deferred sequences are lazily cached during assertion: each element produced at most once, infinite sequences supported\n\t\t\t- Readable failure descriptions: actual count stated, at most five elements shown, elements rendered by ToString capped at 50 characters\n\t\t\t- Throws() and DoesNotThrow are included in the generated specification; clearer failure when Throws(expected) receives a look-alike exception instance\n\t\t\t- SetupFailed instead of NotImplementedException for unsupported mock setups",
